        <mxCell id="p2-safety-note" value="Permanent means permanent: code 6, code 7, ambiguous delivery, and unknown application results with undocumented side effects create an exact (Flickr photo ID, Flickr group ID) do-not-resubmit fact. Elapsed time, an unmoderated interval, cancellation, repair, history retention, or client/admin action never clears it. FGA components expose no force-resubmit path." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=15;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
